# Build context of every image is the repository root (apps/*/Dockerfile).
# Never in an image: dependencies (installed inside from the lockfile),
# environment files and local state.
**/node_modules
.git
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
.atl
.cache
.codegraph
**/*.log

# Build outputs: each image builds its own.
**/dist
apps/web/build
**/.svelte-kit

# Tests output and documents no image uses.
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/coverage
docs
odd
.github
docker-compose.yml

# clients/ stays: the web build copies clients/*/static into its static files
# (apps/web/plugins/client-static.ts) and the API image compiles clients/*/pack.ts
# for `client-load`.
# Real product files of client packs are uploaded to the bucket, never baked into an image.
clients/*/files/
